{"text":"Now, not long ago, I wrote an article about what it means to be young and female in Lagos, and a point has told me it was so angry. Of course it was angry. I am angry. Gender as it functions today is a grieving justice. We should all be angry. Anger has a long history of bringing about positive change, but in addition to being angry, I'm also hopeful. Because I believe deeply in the ability of human beings to make and remake themselves for the better. Gender matters everywhere in the world, but I want to focus on Nigeria, and on Africa in general, because it is where I know, and because it is where my heart is. And I would like today to ask that we begin to dream about and plan for a different world, a fairer world.","words":[{"text":"Now","start":0.0,"end":0.84,"punct":","},{"text":"not","start":0.9,"end":0.98},{"text":"long","start":0.98,"end":1.16},{"text":"ago","start":1.16,"end":1.38,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":1.38,"end":1.5},{"text":"wrote","start":1.5,"end":1.6},{"text":"an","start":1.6,"end":1.78},{"text":"article","start":1.78,"end":2.04},{"text":"about","start":2.04,"end":2.42},{"text":"what","start":2.42,"end":2.96},{"text":"it","start":2.96,"end":3.18},{"text":"means","start":3.18,"end":3.64},{"text":"to","start":3.64,"end":4.12},{"text":"be","start":4.12,"end":4.22},{"text":"young","start":4.22,"end":4.42},{"text":"and","start":4.42,"end":4.6},{"text":"female","start":4.6,"end":4.98},{"text":"in","start":4.98,"end":5.34},{"text":"Lagos","start":5.34,"end":5.74,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":6.08,"end":6.08},{"text":"a","start":6.08,"end":6.64},{"text":"point","start":6.64,"end":6.78},{"text":"has","start":6.78,"end":7.02},{"text":"told","start":7.02,"end":7.32},{"text":"me","start":7.32,"end":7.62},{"text":"it","start":7.62,"end":8.62},{"text":"was","start":8.62,"end":8.76},{"text":"so","start":8.76,"end":9.0},{"text":"angry","start":9.0,"end":9.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"Of","start":10.4,"end":10.54},{"text":"course","start":10.54,"end